note State shared between the firmware platform loop and the on-screen workflow.
note Declared once, before both, because Omega globals must precede their use.
note Es: width,height,scale,left,top,MAC ready,network ready,dirty,epoch base,ms base,
note pointer drag rows,last firmware error,last network retry.
global Es ulong 16
global Dmo ulong 4
global Dprm uchar 160
global Dprmn ulong 1
global Dstat ulong 1
